    {
      "i": 17902,
      "title": "Analytics Dashboard API returning empty responses and HTTP 429 errors",
      "description": "In our production ANZ environment, the Analytics Dashboard API is intermittently returning HTTP 200 OK responses with empty JSON bodies, as well as HTTP 429 Too Many Requests errors. This is affecting 51 users who rely on this data for reporting. The empty responses seem to coincide with the 429s, suggesting a throttling or backend issue. We need clarification on the rate limits and why successful calls are returning no data."
    },
