    {
      "i": 17905,
      "title": "Token Service password reset links expiring prematurely",
      "description": "Users in our US-West production environment are reporting that password reset links generated by the Token Service are expiring before they can be used. The links appear to have a validity period of only a few minutes, whereas our configuration expects a 24-hour window. This is affecting 44 users who are unable to regain access to their accounts without manual intervention. Please verify the token expiration settings in the service."
    },
